# Cloudflare Pages security headers — applied to all served routes.
# Deliberately NO strict Content-Security-Policy here: StewardMD ships inline <script>/<style> in
# index.html + the portal, so a script-src CSP would break the app. (A nonce-based CSP is a separate,
# careful task.) These four are behaviour-neutral for a same-origin HTTPS PWA.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(self), microphone=(self), payment=()

# The CliniX video shim is the ONE page that must be framable cross-origin. The native app is a
# Capacitor WebView whose origin is capacitor://localhost, so the site-wide X-Frame-Options
# SAMEORIGIN above blocks it and YouTube never loads inside a lesson. This override is scoped to
# that single path.
#
# What it exposes: a static page that renders the official YouTube iframe for one of six
# allow-listed video ids and nothing else. No user data, no auth, no app code, no forms, noindex.
# There is nothing on it to clickjack, which is what X-Frame-Options exists to prevent.
#
# frame-ancestors is the modern replacement for X-Frame-Options and browsers honour it in
# preference when both are present.
/_site/yt
  X-Frame-Options: ALLOWALL
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' capacitor: https://localhost http://localhost https://stewardmd.in

# RadioAnatome slice images are immutable reference imagery (a slice file's bytes never change;
# an edit ships under a new module or filename). The default was max-age=14400, must-revalidate,
# so the edge round-tripped to the origin on every hit past 4 h — that is the ~5 s cold open the
# viewer showed. Cache them for a year and serve stale-while-revalidate so first paint is fast.
# The 3D layer's manifest/index (rebuilt per release) get a short TTL override below.
/atlas/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, stale-while-revalidate=86400
/atlas/3d/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400
